POSIX: the POSIX functions (process, user and group IDs, terminals,
...).

The module posix of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/posix.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its
headers in include/php74/php/ext/posix.
